# Both are generated by `pnpm run env:apply <environment>` from env/ — see
# env.manifest.ts. Never hand-edited, so never committed.
.dev.vars*

# Values, per environment. The public half is committed on purpose: none of it
# is confidential, and having it in the repo is what makes a fresh clone need
# only the secrets. The secret half never is.
env/*.secret.env
